---
import { DOCKER_RUN } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col items-stretch justify-between gap-6 rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface p-6 sm:gap-8 sm:p-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:p-12"
    >
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <p class="eyebrow">
          <span class="inline-block size-1.5 rounded-full bg-salsa-orange"></span>
          Self-Hosted / Open Source
        </p>
        <h2 class="display-serif mt-3 text-2xl text-balance sm:text-3xl">Desplegá tu propio Motor Caleño</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm text-muted sm:text-base">
          Ejecutá OpenChuspa localmente en Docker con soporte completo para clusterización S3 y cifrado de datos "Sello
          Caleño".
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="min-w-0 shrink-0 font-mono text-xs lg:max-w-md">
        <div class="mb-2 text-muted">Comando Docker de una línea:</div>
        <code class="code-box mb-3 block text-ink">{DOCKER_RUN}</code>
        <button type="button" data-copy={DOCKER_RUN} class="btn-primary w-full py-2.5 text-white">Copiar Docker Run</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
